Draw Switch 2 task and mesh programs through compute. Ported from Lichii: translation of the two
stages (310dd596d, eb02d1dd5, a10e5f556), the pipeline and draw plumbing (02504aeb3, b00481fcc) and
the compute fallback (#569 by emiliopedrollo and others, 7d3b3a526). The task and mesh programs
run as compute shaders that write their vertices and indices to a storage buffer, and a generated
vertex shader draws that buffer as a triangle list. PS5 hardware has no usable native mesh path, so
the frontend always asks for this one (EDEN_NX2_FORCE_MESH_FALLBACK). Replaces the layer that
skipped these draws; a mesh draw that cannot be built is still dropped without failing the
submission. Bumps the translator salt.

